<title>USA: LeaRonal says board approves buyback plan.</title>
<headline>LeaRonal says board approves buyback plan.</headline>
<dateline>FREEPORT, N.Y. 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>LeaRonal Inc said Tuesday its board approved a revised stock buyback plan for the purchase of up to 500,000 common shares at market prices.</p>
<p>As of Feb. 28, the specialty chemicals company had working capital of about $76 million, long-term debt of $4 million and stockholder equity of $113 million.</p>
